: goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle first passed with one P6 advisory for compound acceptance criteria. Split preserve-item, consumer-contract, executable-behavior, and assertion outcomes; re-review passed clean and signed at 25d1d683e55a. Updated the delivery story and epic descriptions to independently verifiable criteria and to encode the user-required per-ticket Gerrit/main/close ordering. First delivery-story review was not admitted: GATE_CONGESTED, all 4 host slots in use; no verdict. Will retry later without force.","timestamp":1788586085751022001}],"created_at":1788584670051760001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2d1892a6-56c9-4419-b2fa-d7c45df0fd02","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"61c7-401f-9fd5-406f","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Execute rubbery-glacial-cowbird: grouped comment remediation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bcbfa0a1-2401-48e3-9291-7961c954aadd","2d1892a6-56c9-4419-b2fa-d7c45df0fd02","67454b8f-3936-463e-b9a5-58f5593796cd","784fb501-08d0-4cee-a18a-6e508cf78add"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788589162966363641,"uuid":"13a64c7c-7435-478e-9daa-b79584652efc"}